<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Hnnngh ...Huh?\rI walked way too far today lookin’\nfor homies to recruit.\rMy dogs is barkin’ and I’m\nso tired, bro...\rIf I was a wild homie, I’d be\nthe easiest recruit ever...\r...Zzzz...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Hnnngh! ...Huh?\rI got a urge to read some words\noff a piece of paper or somethin’...\r...Zzz...\n...!!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? What?\nWhat about that homie?\fI ain’t got no mail.\rZzz...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Mail ain’t for me.\nWho even write letters no more?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayy! I got mail!\r...\nHuh?\fI don’t know this homie.\fI’ma let you handle that.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed over the homie\nholdin’ the Mail.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed over the Mail.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s see...\r“Good looks on the Mail.\nIt was a wild trip, fr.\rZUBAT was buggin’, though...”\nThat’s what it say.\rI went in a dark cave the other\nday with a homie.\rThat cave lead to another route.\nAnyway, I gotta show love for\fyou bein’ so solid.\rLemme bless you with somethin’.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TM44 is...\n...Zzz...\f...\r...Umm... Nap!\rLike, “I need a nap,” but\nshorter. Nap. You feel me?\fIt put you to sleep and heal you up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...I’m\nso sleepy, bro...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Wait!\nThen you wouldn’t have\fno homies left!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I found a hard homie in Dark Cave.\nI’ma raise it up to run on\fFalkner.\rHe the Block Boss of Violet City.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Dark Cave...\rIf a homie could light it up,\nI’d go in. It’s DARK dark.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rt. 31\nWest to Violet City. No Loitering.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Dark Cave\nBring a Flashlight. Or Don’t.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0378_R31_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? What is it?\nIs that a homie Egg?\fI ain’t never seen one.\r...Zzz...</language>
	</row>
</body>
